...@../../_tools/theme
direction: down
grid-rows: 3
grid-columns: 3

user: 사용자 { class: person }
web: ADK Web UI (adk web) { class: ext }
env: 환경 변수 (.env.example) { class: file }

root: 코디네이터 (root_agent.yaml) { class: file }
research: 리서치 에이전트 (research_agent.yaml) { class: file }
summary: 요약 에이전트 (summary_agent.yaml) { class: file }

gemini: Gemini API (gemini-3-flash-preview) { class: ext }
mcp: Firecrawl MCP 서버 (npx firecrawl-mcp) { class: ext }
cloud: Firecrawl 클라우드 (firecrawl.dev) { class: ext }

user -> web: 메시지
web -> root: 로드 (from_config)
root -> research: sub_agents: config_path
root -> summary: sub_agents: config_path
research -> mcp: MCPToolset (npx 프로세스)
mcp -> cloud: firecrawl_scrape / firecrawl_search
root -> gemini: 모델 호출
research -> gemini: 모델 호출
summary -> gemini: 모델 호출
